  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to balance security with performance and sustainability. I support the integration of error handling (SAF-04) within performance thresholds (EFF-04) while ensuring thoroughness is not compromised. Aligning audit trail requirements (SAF-03 and TRU-03) to reduce redundancy is essential, but we must maintain the integrity and accountability of the audit trail. I also agree to evaluate caching strategies (EFF-05) for their energy impact while ensuring they do not weaken our security measures, particularly in user access controls (TRU-02). Lastly, I propose we incorporate security assessments into performance evaluations to maintain a balance between efficiency and security.",
